SUMMARY:Election Day!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nTuesday\, November 3rd is Elect
 ion day!\nLast day to register to vote ahead of this election is October 1
 9th\, 2026!\nMake sure you cast your vote!\n\nhttps://www.pa.gov/agencies/
 vote/elections/upcoming-elections.html\n\nThe Lancaster Freethought Societ
 y encourages consideration of the values of Free-Thought and Secularism wh
 en evaluating policies\, candidates\, and political parties.\n\nComment be
 low and let us know that you voted\, and please tell us what criteria guid
 e you in making your selections!
