SUMMARY:Neptune Diner Meetup November!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nWe will be meeting for brunch a
 nd discussion at a local diner! This one is a bit later in the morning tha
 n usual for those who like to sleep in!\n\nNeptune Diner\n924 N. Prince St
 .\nLancaster PA 17603\n\nNeptune Diner is on the right side of the one-way
  Prince St. It has its own sizable parking lot adjacent. If you pass the B
 aseball stadium you've gone too far!\n\nWe look forward to seeing you!
