SUMMARY:2026 PA Renaissance Faire Field Trip!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nWe will be going on a field tri
 p to the PA Renaissance Faire this year\, on Sunday\, November 29th! The e
 vent will run from 11am - 4:30pm!\n\nTickets for this event are approx. $3
 0 per person. We will individually purchase our tickets\, make sure you ha
 ve selected the correct date in their 'box office'! I recommend that we al
 l purchase tickets ahead of time so that we can all go on the same day and
  ensure that they are not sold out! Day of\, we'll meet in the parking lot
  and enter as a group!\n\nhttps://www.parenfaire.com\n\nSunday\, November 
 29th\n11:00am - 4:30pm\n\nPA Renaissance Faire\n2775 Lebanon Road\, Manhei
 m PA 17545
